Viktor 10.10.2026: «Для кнопки Generate song, если есть уже Score в поле, тогда попап с вопросом: Генерим на существующей партитуре, или новая? И нужно иметь сторожа для LoRA адаптеров и силы их весов. При изменении силы партитура может сильно изменяться, особенно с Industrial Rock и Instrumental… При FULL режиме всегда держим Supply Your Own Score открытым, если поле партитуры не пустое».

A score in the form remembers the adapters' music halves that wrote it (a plan; a take's own score from Retake, its request or the pencil), kept in this browser by the score's own text. Under the score a line says when the adapters on now differ (amber). Generate with a score (Full or Melody, no codes loaded) asks: on this score, a new score (the field emptied, the song model writes one), or stay; the difference is said in the question. In Full the score stays open while it holds one. The Kit's checks have the question off (yue2.askScore), as they have playing on.

Suite: 596/0 in the kitchen.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
